{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49836","headline":"菩萨蛮 五 · 冯延巳","name":"菩萨蛮 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娇鬟堆枕钗横凤，溶溶春水杨花梦。\n红烛泪阑干，翠屏烟浪寒。\n锦壶催画箭，玉佩天涯远。\n和泪试严妆，落梅飞夜霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}